  "locked": true,
  "problems": [],
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "B1",
      "duration": 15.075,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B1.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "94fc9fe2b81abc8bc8a4846b006c5188b646a41bae0782785a282009db838f46",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "What happens when weight is placed on a bridge?",
          "start": 0.4,
          "end": 3.825,
          "rel_start": 0.0,
          "rel_end": 3.425
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Traffic, people and the weight of the bridge itself all press on its deck.",
          "start": 4.225,
          "end": 9.825,
          "rel_start": 3.825,
          "rel_end": 9.425
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "To stay standing, the bridge has to carry that load down into the ground.",
          "start": 10.225,
          "end": 15.475,
          "rel_start": 9.825,
          "rel_end": 15.075
        }
      ],
      "shot": "SC_001",
      "shots": [
        "SC_001"
      ],
      "start_seconds": 0.4
    },
    {
      "id": "B2",
      "duration": 20.6,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B2.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "2b60aa7d5a05ecd92ebee8e552d1be032afd72adda45ef1bd884f9fa8c21e5cf",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "The load follows a path down through the structure.",
          "start": 16.691667,
          "end": 20.341667,
          "rel_start": 0.0,
          "rel_end": 3.65
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "The deck is carried by the superstructure, the part of the bridge that spans the gap.",
          "start": 20.741667,
          "end": 26.341667,
          "rel_start": 4.05,
          "rel_end": 9.65
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "That rests on the substructure: abutments at the ends, and sometimes piers in between.",
          "start": 26.741667,
          "end": 32.891667,
          "rel_start": 10.05,
          "rel_end": 16.2
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "The abutments pass the load on to the foundations.",
          "start": 33.291667,
          "end": 37.291667,
          "rel_start": 16.6,
          "rel_end": 20.6
        }
      ],
      "shot": "SC_002",
      "shots": [
        "SC_002"
      ],
      "start_seconds": 16.691667
    },
    {
      "id": "B3",
      "duration": 19.025,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B3.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "893e44040026cc68990ee4a51cfa956081b52d76f43172c248a5c4f802b5556d",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Now take a beam bridge.",
          "start": 38.525,
          "end": 40.9,
          "rel_start": 0.0,
          "rel_end": 2.375
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Its deck rests on long beams that span from one support to the next.",
          "start": 41.3,
          "end": 46.7,
          "rel_start": 2.775,
          "rel_end": 8.175
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "Each beam carries the load by resisting bending.",
          "start": 47.1,
          "end": 51.025,
          "rel_start": 8.575,
          "rel_end": 12.5
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "A cap beam spreads the load onto the posts, and the posts carry it down in compression.",
          "start": 51.425,
          "end": 57.55,
          "rel_start": 12.9,
          "rel_end": 19.025
        }
      ],
      "shot": "SC_003",
      "shots": [
        "SC_003"
      ],
      "start_seconds": 38.525
    },
    {
      "id": "B4",
      "duration": 8.9,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B4.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "369d3b35ce95009c0e401a62646b67ca31e0e4be5d1b0ab83135fd3ab195fd7a",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "A masonry arch works differently.",
          "start": 58.775,
          "end": 61.675,
          "rel_start": 0.0,
          "rel_end": 2.9
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "It is built from wedge-shaped stones called voussoirs, with a keystone at the crown.",
          "start": 62.075,
          "end": 67.675,
          "rel_start": 3.3,
          "rel_end": 8.9
        }
      ],
      "shot": "SC_004",
      "shots": [
        "SC_004",
        "SC_005"
      ],
      "start_seconds": 58.775
    },
    {
      "id": "B5",
      "duration": 16.15,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B5.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "4ff66aed0e06156734b662f6c665c1cd791376bf33123c53fd642b7bea3352cf",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "The curve turns the downward load into thrust along the arch, pressing the stones together.",
          "start": 68.9,
          "end": 75.125,
          "rel_start": 0.0,
          "rel_end": 6.225
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "So the arch works mainly in compression.",
          "start": 75.525,
          "end": 78.95,
          "rel_start": 6.625,
          "rel_end": 10.05
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "At each end it pushes outward and down on its supports, and the supports push back.",
          "start": 79.35,
          "end": 85.05,
          "rel_start": 10.45,
          "rel_end": 16.15
        }
      ],
      "shot": "SC_006",
      "shots": [
        "SC_006"
      ],
      "start_seconds": 68.9
    },
    {
      "id": "B6",
      "duration": 27.525,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B6.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "dad1c8d734b308573a83799547ef9f4ccf4b6e216cd0fcd48e1c2014034fe93d",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "The truss we started with takes another approach: straight members joined into triangles.",
          "start": 86.275,
          "end": 92.55,
          "rel_start": 0.0,
          "rel_end": 6.275
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Each member is mainly pulled or pushed along its length, in tension or in compression.",
          "start": 92.95,
          "end": 99.325,
          "rel_start": 6.675,
          "rel_end": 13.05
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "Each span here is a simple span, so under a downward load its top chord is squeezed and its bottom chord is stretched.",
          "start": 99.725,
          "end": 108.025,
          "rel_start": 13.45,
          "rel_end": 21.75
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "Inside, some web members are in compression and others are in tension.",
          "start": 108.425,
          "end": 113.8,
          "rel_start": 22.15,
          "rel_end": 27.525
        }
      ],
      "shot": "SC_007",
      "shots": [
        "SC_007"
      ],
      "start_seconds": 86.275
    },
    {
      "id": "B7",
      "duration": 18.725,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B7.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "98980ebdc560eab7d77eec7fa0efa417ff2afb5c04f7d525b3f87403619a2ee8",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Let's compare them one at a time.",
          "start": 115.025,
          "end": 118.1,
          "rel_start": 0.0,
          "rel_end": 3.075
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "The beam bridge carries its load by bending.",
          "start": 118.5,
          "end": 122.125,
          "rel_start": 3.475,
          "rel_end": 7.1
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "The arch carries it mainly in compression, pushing against its supports.",
          "start": 122.525,
          "end": 127.625,
          "rel_start": 7.5,
          "rel_end": 12.6
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "In the truss, the load is shared between members in tension and in compression.",
          "start": 128.025,
          "end": 133.75,
          "rel_start": 13.0,
          "rel_end": 18.725
        }
      ],
      "shot": "SC_008",
      "shots": [
        "SC_008",
        "SC_009",
        "SC_010"
      ],
      "start_seconds": 115.025
    },
    {
      "id": "B8",
      "duration": 15.525,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B8.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "0608ad3015977f9bc105d292df059e45b35cbf62bf93a2319d2d944ae38b16f8",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Three arrangements of parts, one job: carrying the load across the gap and down into the ground.",
          "start": 134.983333,
          "end": 141.758333,
          "rel_start": 0.0,
          "rel_end": 6.775
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "These models are illustrations, not engineering designs, and the arrows show ideas, not calculated forces.",
          "start": 142.158333,
          "end": 150.508333,
          "rel_start": 7.175,
          "rel_end": 15.525
        }
      ],
      "shot": "SC_011",
      "shots": [
        "SC_011"
      ],
      "start_seconds": 134.983333
    }
  ],
